      "short": "$5(3x-2)$ or $15x-10$",
      "worked": "A regular pentagon has five equal sides.\n$$\\begin{align*}P&=5(3x-2)\\\\P&=5(3x)+5(-2)\\\\P&=15x-10\\end{align*}$$",
